<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sometime during COVID, I started paying a lot of attention to the weather. It started with the rainy season. Getting a sense of the coming week and how much rain might fall. After that, I started to share my forecast with a small, interested mountain group. I initially shut the forecasting down during the Summer, but it turns out there is weather during Summer, too. And fires.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Fast forward to today, and the robots have built a dashboard every thirty minutes with all the particulars.</p>

